id: pm-vcs-nzw9
title: Rename the git interoperability commands under a pm vcs git prefix
description: "The three commands that reason about a git checkout moved from pm vcs preflight, pm vcs preview and pm vcs items to pm vcs git preflight, pm vcs git preview and pm vcs git items. The rename makes the boundary visible in the command surface itself: everything under pm vcs operates on a pm-vcs repository, and everything under pm vcs git touches git. Recorded as an item so the generated changelog carries it, since the changelog is produced from the tracker rather than hand-written. No installed user is affected because the package has never been published to npm, its release being gated on maintainer approval."
